XMMS - X Multimedia System (C) 1997-2004, 2026

A Cross platform Multimedia Player

Peter Alm, Thomas Nilsson, Olle Hallnas, Håvard Kvålen
and, since 2026, the CGTK authors

XMMS is the audio player of 1997-2007, built today against CGTK, the
Classic GUI Toolkit, which is GTK+ 1.2 brought to current systems. It
runs on X11 and on Wayland, keeps its Winamp 2 skins, and plays MPEG
audio, Ogg Vorbis, Opus, FLAC, AAC and Apple Lossless, WAV and module
files, from disk or from http and https streams. What has changed since
1.2.11 is in ChangeLog, and 1.2.11's own README, NEWS, ChangeLog,
AUTHORS, FAQ and TODO are in history/xmms, as they were released.


